  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Yes, leaving the house is an event. And our Riley crossbody bag is here for it. This structured suede bag makes everyday things feel a little more special. Hold it by the top handle when you want to look pulled-together, or clip on the adjustable strap to go hands-free. The exterior slip pocket is there when you need it. (You'll need it.)</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Suede</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 4&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8&quot; (L) x 5.9&quot; (H) x 3.40&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
